        "text": "Using Widgets\nThe keys to the Plasma desktop environment are the widgets . Widgets are small\napplications that run on the desktop. Each widget provides a different utility or\nsmall program to use in your desktop. This section walks through how to add,\nremove, and get new widgets in your Plasma environment.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Adding widgets\n\u2022 Getting more widgets\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
